      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone who literally started from 0 Modelling Knowledge, 0 Avatar or World Making Knowledge, and 0 Unity Knowledge-- I think you're being a bit overdramatic about the length and tribulations that you need to go through with VCC and Udon-- Hell, I hardly even needed to use Udon or the Graph system to get a decent world up, and the VCC literally only made the process easier.  It just feels needless, and maybe like you hadn't even tried it before getting into a fit about it-- And if you did, I can't imagine what would be causing you so much distress.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
